, "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "Paid Cobalt Labs's approved invoice by wire.\n\n- **Invoice:** INV-59040 (status: approved, due 2026-11-04)\n- **Amount:** $4,035.53 (paid in full)\n- **Rail:** Wire, from the operating account\n- **Payment ID:** PAY0001 (status: sent)\n\nThe vendor record shows wire is available and the bank details are verified, so ACH was not needed. The amount is under $10,000, so no controller approval was required. The payment was sent once, using an idempotency key. I did not touch Cobalt Labs's other invoices: INV-24311 is still a draft awaiting approval, and INV-56025 is already paid.", "type": "text"}]}]}